  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      264.65,
      401.9,
      288.23
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      301.49,
      401.88,
      325.19
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Sri Lanka Electricity(Amendment) Act, No. of 2022.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      338.45,
      401.92,
      386.63
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 8 of the Sri Lanka Electricity Act, No. 20 of2009 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) ishereby repealed and the following section substitutedtherefor:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      399.89,
      401.88,
      423.59
    ],
    "text": "8. Any person may participate in a biddingprocess for the generation of electricity.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      473.69,
      401.88,
      497.39
    ],
    "text": "3.Section 9 of the principal enactment is herebyamended as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      180.09,
      510.65,
      401.88,
      534.23
    ],
    "text": "(1) by the repeal of subsection (1) thereof and thesubstitution therefor of the following:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      209.85,
      547.49,
      401.88,
      583.43
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(1) Any persion shall be eligible to applyfor the issue of a generation licence to generateelectricity.\u201d; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      180.09,
      596.69,
      360.45,
      608.03
    ],
    "text": "(2) by the repeal of subsection (1A) thereof.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      621.29,
      401.88,
      644.99
    ],
    "text": "4.Section 43 of the principal enactment is herebyamended as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
